preview.html

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# NOTE. There are deliberately no *.exe / *.dll / *.wav rules here.
#
# Those are the obvious things to filter out of a C++ repository, and they were
# here originally - which silently swallowed logonui.exe, msgina.dll and every
# sound file when the reference material was first added to assets/. The upload
# looked like it had worked. The build/ and out/ rules above already keep
# compiler output out of the tree, so the extension rules bought nothing and
# cost a lot. If you add one back, exclude the reference material:  !assets/**
